      <div class="about-section-copy">
        <h2 id="mission-heading">Open access to trusted knowledge</h2>
        <p class="about-lead">
          CLIR Publications advances open access to knowledge by organizing, preserving, and sharing
          publications that support libraries, archives, and research communities.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Our goal is simple: make trusted resources easier to discover and use, while ensuring that
          work produced across CLIR initiatives remains available over time.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
